href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T02:49:27-07:00","id":161527,"title":"","content":"Hmm, nice.<br /> <br /> I would really include Changelings among the ones the oracles are concerned about. They can have prophetic dreams, turn life into a story, make a deal with death to come back to life, and all their powers work by manipulating fate. They should concern the oracles more than the witches, since after all not all witches mess with fate. <br /> <br /> Compacts and conspiracies gives out minor endowments for compacts, instead of just giving allies to the compact version you might want to add a more impresssive ability. Like maybe they're really good at calculating odds to their favor, or their faith sees them through like the long night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T04:07:20-07:00","id":161557,"title":"","content":"It\u00b4s depressing how in the WoD humans who get a few bits of power can be as bad as the supernatural monsters who predates them.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T10:49:15-07:00","id":161860,"title":"","content":"StSword- yeah, I should add Changelings. I'll do it later. About the compact version- for now, I'm working on the conspiracy, so it simply a sidebar. After I'll finish, maybe I'll give it a bit more thought about giving them their own &quot;compact endowment&quot;<br /> <br /> Raistlin- well, it is less about getting a &quot;few bits of power&quot; and more about what do you do with that power. After all, all conspiracies have some weird tricks and magics, and they don't necessary become slashers. The Oracles kill people because they truly, undoubtedly, believe it is for the best- and worse, apparently they are right. After all, the Vision is real, even if manufactured, for it is the best possible future Pythia could find, and while Pythia is many things, she isn't a lair. After all, she could promise them an heaven upon earth and even create a false Vision to fulfill her needs- but she doesn't. It is more about desperate people who are willing to do anything- anything- in order to make the world into a better place. They are not nice, but they are needed- at least, that is how they see it. Their sacrifices are made out of free will, else they won't be any different from the regular monsters and slashers. This is why their Vision doesn't force them to kill others- and actually, stops them from doing so.<br /> <br /> In short, they may be monsters- but it is for an higher goal. Deciding if the goal justify the means is the question this conspiracy is meant to make you ask.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T23:35:00-07:00","id":162272,"title":"","content":"Well, I wouldn't say it's about power, it's about faith, and the road to hell.<br /> <br /> And really, while that is the focus of the conspiracy, that doesn't really set them apart from the other hunters. Unlike the slayers in buffy the vampire slayer, the hunter book specifically says that a lot of hunters don't turn a blind eye to human monsters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T02:04:40-07:00","id":168735,"title":"","content":"Updated Status and added Changelings to the Enemy section.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T01:49:13-08:00","id":404282,"title":"","content":"And after long time, I've finished the Endowments. This conspiracy is finally done!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T02:53:37-08:00","id":404342,"title":"","content":"So, for each dot in endowments the seer can chose one of the benefits, right? also, are those permanents, or can be changed for each &quot;vision&quot; to furfill (after all, differents missions require different tools)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T06:03:04-08:00","id":404413,"title":"","content":"Actually, there is such restriction. All you have to do is to make the roll [Vision + Skill] to gain the benefit of the certain power for 2*[Vision] hours, and you need to expand a WP point ever time you use an active power, or once in the initial roll when adjusting a passive power. You don't buy the powers themselves, just dots in Vision and the appropriate Skill.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T08:20:44-08:00","id":404484,"title":"","content":"But only one power on a time, right? or they can use as many as their dots in Vision?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T09:51:37-08:00","id":404603,"title":"","content":"As many as their Vision. I wouldn't want to force someone to a single power for 10 hours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T15:42:38-07:00","id":889400,"title":"","content":"<b><u>Bonus Material- Where the Serpent Dreams</u></b><br /> <br /> Delphi was a special please- a singularity, one of its kind. The combination of the toxins who mixed in the water together with the arcane forces and sympathies which bound it to the Astral has made it into a gateway to a future. That phenomena, like any good mystery, required a special set of conditions and limitation in order to come into existence- and once those conditions were violated, the spell was broken. Today, while Pythia still sits in Delphi, it is done out of honor to tradition and the role of the ancient place in the creation of the Oracles. Delphi's glory is no more, and there won't be another Delphi ever again.<br /> <br /> Or would it?<br /> <br /> Los Angels- the City of Angeles, the City of Dreams. Unknown to most of the world, those dreams has took over their dreamers, gaining life of their own. They whisper arcane secrets to those who gave birth to them in their hope and despair. They sing in their dreams and take over them when they are drunk and drugged. Passions take over their makers, Vices and Virtues become living beings. Even the city itself glimmers with the light of its own fantasies, as imaginary structures appear and vanish without trace, and its phantasmal walls carry secret messages about the future. The City dreams itself into life, following its own Vision for the future.<br /> <br /> For the Oracles, L.A is a mystery- some claim that perhaps it is a sign, a blessing from the Serpent in order to guide its seers toward the brilliant future shown in their Vision. For others, its a threat- something is growing in Los Angels and gets out of control, and it could reshape the future they put so much efforts to rule. The dreamers themselves present a more interesting dilemma- for each of those touched by the Serpent could be a potential recruit, yet they lack the means required in order to separate the true prophets from the false ones, something which could end up with the future member getting killed because of the catalyst used to tune into the Vision. Worse, the Oracles seems more vulnerable than the average person to the manipulations of the Goetia- for while Pythia's Vision grant them a measure of protection (add your dots in Vision for any roll made to resist being Ridden/Influenced by a Goetia), they shine like a beacon of light, luring the many critters toward them. For that reason, only the strongest seers are allowed to travel in L.A, as they investigate the strange dreams the city spawns in its sleep.<br /> <br /> Well, that and because all of those nosy mages.<br /> <br /> Because of the Oracles' nature, many of the mages of the city believe them to be no more than a form of dreamers- which makes them into a resource to fight over (the fact that they by themselves try to claim dreamers is irrelevant). The problem is that even in regular situations the Oracles recognize witches as a threat- and in L.A, they are also competition. Those hunters who operate in Los Angeles are so famous for their attack against witches, that many hunters in the regions are unaware of their other, darker activities while the mages who were able to connect the dots believe them to be a group of dreamers manipulated by a cabal of Banishers- or worse, being Banishers by themselves.<br /> <br /> While Los Angeles is an endless battlefield, Pythia insist on maintaining a stable presence in the city- in fact, lately not only that certain high ranked members were moved to L.A, but some of Pythia's processors are contained there as well. That fact and the exact location of those processors is a deep secret, of course, and those who are aware for that fact believe that Pythia is planning to move to the city and take over it. Sure, the witches are a problem and the Daemons must be tamed, but Pythia is one of the greatest strategists in the world. If she is going to move to the city, she would take over it, conquering its dreams and purge all threats- including the mages who are two busy at fighting each other than noticing her as she coils around them. The war would be bloody, and sacrifices are required to be made- but that is no different from how those hunters usually live their life. If that is truly her plan, and she will succeed, Los Angeles would truly become a new Delphi, shaped by the Vision- and from there, it won't be long before her own dream would come true.<br /> <br /> The past is important- but it has to be sacrificed for the brighter future.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}